# QGuard Helix Approved Cryptographic Algorithms Stacks

## Key Exchange

* ML-KEM-768
* X25519 + ML-KEM-768 Hybrid

For High Security Profile like Quantum Vault:

* ML-KEM-1024

## Signatures

* ML-DSA-65
* Ed25519 + ML-DSA-65 Hybrid

Optional High Security Profile: Like Quantum Vault

* ML-DSA-87
* SLH-DSA

## Symmetric Encryption

* AES-256-GCM

## KDF

* HKDF-SHA3-256

Compatibility Fallback:

* HKDF-SHA-256

## Hashing

* SHA3-256
* SHA3-512

## TLS

* TLS 1.3
* X25519MLKEM768 Preferred
* Hybrid TLS Enabled
* Classical Fallback Controlled By Policy

